                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>A comparative study into the institutionalization of parliamentry Democracy in Poland, Hungary, the Czech Republic and Slovakia. Members of the respective parliaments were asked to fill in a questionnaire with questions concerning their opinion on the parliamentry system, their background, their work as an MP, representation, political issues etc.</p>"
